# divergences.scout_autoexplore (settings.json). Start: map_rumour_colonist_outcomes' input.sav (France 1599),
# Seasoned Scout #77 selected on (29,62), full moves, next to an Iroquois village and the (30,62) rumour.
key q        # ORDERS Automate: the unvisited village wins the pick (points of interest -4, scan order), the
wait 30      # pacer walks in: woodcut + @ACTIONS menu (Speak With Chief / Demand Tribute / Attack / Cancel)
key Escape   # Cancel Action: the Scout's moves are spent, the village joins SAUT's entered set; Preacher #131 is selected
wait 30
shot
